epresent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292888 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd8b8883-e4d2-54d8-ab69-df34c9f744ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291711}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291711} :answer-field/id #uuid "12a48a57-6035-5ed9-b984-8d18dc369c91" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291801} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee6c624f-3e47-5b63-9d81-a78ff1204fc9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291629}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291629} :answer-field/id #uuid "39910e5c-07d8-5090-8cd6-1272cf41728b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291924} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c6d71a8-0e74-5884-8126-7aba3400dcd7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291098}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291098} :answer-field/id #uuid "c9c85565-e62c-5944-b3fc-1c0afc53a3cf" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292349}] :question/id #uuid "3bd4ffe0-c49d-548a-9828-1b36d2c269eb" :question/math-academy-id "q-275758" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-4x+2y &=-1 \\\\ x-3y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-1$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $-1$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $2$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $2$ |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{(-4)\\cdot (-3)-1\\cdot 2}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299833 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1790d680-82bb-59eb-86d7-9f7bbffdd1fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{15}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297651} {:answer/id #uuid "17e9f163-baa7-5ae0-b867-54fbc67383ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{27}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -7 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297655} {:answer/id #uuid "50f912d6-ac41-5ecf-88d3-d7c24a071f52" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{27}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -7 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297890} {:answer/id #uuid "b906f95c-4a91-5786-9d56