\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 6-(-3)\\cdot (-3)}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299897 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a42f8a6-1e37-57a1-b79b-0cce8c469322" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297727}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297727} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b99c9b7-8141-513a-be20-c36278c7181b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298674} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ab85a44-bb7a-5cec-baac-c94cdc7f03c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298012}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298012} :answer-field/id #uuid "0bca34ff-10f7-54a1-8911-6da5d5a9f405" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298675} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "605996f9-7b1c-5027-a349-ec460dcea071" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{