eed to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{4\\cdot 3-0\\cdot (-6)}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299899 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed8c3408-9709-5ddb-8def-c078831ec1c1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298562}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298562} :answer-field/id #uuid "237c6539-4411-5ad7-8031-3f8edaf565c6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298754} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51e738f2-a49d-5bc3-baca-e3236c9d02ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297898}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297898} :answer-field/id #uuid "66c38295-8821-52ed-ae87-bf5e93d4f39d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298985} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ae0221e-1368-590e-b437-b5eac248c32a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297670}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297670} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ffb626f-a92d-5184-a68a-b6d957bf1da4" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299113}] :question/id #uuid "f32b9d41-3197-5ac1-bd1f-a220e0c2f816" :question/math-academy-id "q-320801" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5y &=6 \\\\ 2x-y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-5$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $6$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-7$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-5$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |\n|  | $6$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-7$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{0\\cdot (-1)-2\\cdot 5}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299900 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a6daa68-067f-5b3c-a3fc-4c4f63d8b357" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298226}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298226} :answer-field/id #uuid "40fabe15-e539-5832-ae0c-0398ba1d156e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/r