ed}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299903 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62223187-3535-5ced-bf2f-281fcdc0b75d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297970}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297970} :answer-field/id #uuid "4864b4e5-2627-5511-b80f-18e6432445f9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298882} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a6670d69-76ee-530f-b59c-41cbaabe2627" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298281}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298281} :answer-field/id #uuid "700dd9c1-286a-5a21-b2cd-03627763d22d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299015} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7109bf86-a3fa-5fb0-bc66-d15e803c47c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298039}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298039} :answer-field/id #uuid "cb24170f-cf32-56fb-8495-db2604022620" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299316}] :question/id #uuid "4abd9c73-5e51-5caf-ba50-a0a3bd5f24cf" :question/math-academy-id "q-320806" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+3y &=5 \\\\ 4x+y &=11\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-3$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-4$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $5$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $11$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-3$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $-4$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |\n|  | $5$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $11$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 11\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{(-2)\\cdot 1-4\\cdot 3}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{14}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{14}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 11\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302055 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ac90acb-2dc9-54df-ad8c-312064a7ee7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300169} {:answer/id #uuid "315aba2d-f457-5a05-b918-8c2570f4c19c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300202} {:answer/id #uuid "816e41d5-294b-558a-af5d-f694f628fb45" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300604} {:answer/id