 be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{7\\cdot 4-(-1)\\cdot 1}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{29}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{29}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302057 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a57a0b8-90bf-5b06-94fd-25cfb7e9fd08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{17}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300167} {:answer/id #uuid "37dc3f49-cc56-5d7d-abed-c68092d4d734" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{15}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300232} {:answer/id #uuid "49172283-e38d-52de-8690-95c2d72ebf8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{17}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300335} {:answer/id #uuid "e74e9bb5-1ccf-5fb8-97c5-4c43923f1848" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{17}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301106} {:answer/id #uuid "e911b046-43cf-547b-853d-911580ab57cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{15}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end