\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}={e}^{-t}\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nNotice that for each vector $\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix},$ we get the straight-line solutions of the form\n${e}^{-t}\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}$\nthat represent the line passing through the origin and parallel to the vector $\\begin{bmatrix}{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nSince ${e}^{-t}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$ \n\nAmong the given options, the only phase portrait satisfying these conditions is the following:\n\n![](images/6b/6bdaece2579041f23a73323c4317751dfd8266364633bd2af258437b53d4a6f9.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308433 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "38222be5-d9a9-5031-97aa-d0a0f893e4d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ea/ea7ff4f032bade692953813c58b34ba62ab9c525c71ac13a2256dda6285e6620.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305688} {:answer/id #uuid "386e2c6f-3184-5a4b-a636-12cd508e4b67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/2a/2acd3b0de16138b460a332cf6e4841e6caeeb5dbb23eef8f411dbdb5ce48ea42.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305693} {:answer/id #uuid "4079a91b-a67e-5149-9030-68382859db82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7e/7e48266d30ae7c204b25e6eddca968d1b4ce9cd8e1c7b19cd20247fa66070f0b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305781} {:answer/id #uuid "5ba4bbc4-1b69-5f49-aa4c-e29dcd64cfb8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7b/7be65c63a4e5dcbe73fbc63faf3f061476ecd478cef8d58776bb843bfe84df2c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306030} {:answer/id #uuid "c9860ea1-a4ab-5d04-ab2c-ff795fb28d6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/eb/eba955015a4b919c65dc24facb0baa6e745df134feac32feeae07c99d40ff4ec.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/t